# panel fixture: a third click returns EDIT to steady green and the keys toggle again
# manual: p068, p069
# workflow: EDIT cycle
at 0 ms click mode.edit
at 1000 ms click mode.edit
at 2000 ms click mode.edit
expect led mode.edit = green steady
at 3000 ms click step(3,5)
expect command SetStep track=3 step=4 attr=Active value=1
expect engine step 3 5 active = true
